asahi/vulkan: link libvulkan_asahi with vulkan_icd_link_args

Every other Vulkan ICD links with vulkan_icd_link_args (the vulkan.sym version script on Linux).
On Darwin the recipe sets it to -undefined dynamic_lookup: the generated entrypoint tables take
weak references to every entrypoint, which Mach-O can only leave unresolved that way.
Upstream: the Linux half (the version script) would be.

--- a/src/asahi/vulkan/meson.build
+++ b/src/asahi/vulkan/meson.build
@@ -529,7 +529,7 @@
 libvulkan_asahi = shared_library(
   'vulkan_asahi',
   link_whole : [libhk],
-  link_args: [ld_args_build_id],
+  link_args: [vulkan_icd_link_args, ld_args_build_id],
   gnu_symbol_visibility : 'hidden',
   install : true,
 )
